  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - Reason:\r\nOn 16/05/2025, the proposal as shown on the drawing submitted on 16/05/2025 and numbered Unreferenced Location Plan, P-01, P-02 was not lawful because:\r\n\r\nThe development fails to comply with the terms of Class A.2, Clause (a) of Part 1 of Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) because:\r\n\r\nAs the dwellinghouse stands on article 2(3) land (Bedfont Green Conservation Area), development is not permitted by class A as it would consist of or include the cladding of any part of the exterior of the dwellinghouse with stone, artificial stone , pebble dash, render, timber, plastic or tiles.\r\n"
